WEBVTT

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:05.760
Thank goodness!

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.730
They've all grown back wonderfully!

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:10.940
They smell so nice!

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:12.440
They really do smell nice!

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:13.860
It's all thanks to our hard work! {Does she make some sort of noise before saying this?}

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:16.640
Yeah, we've given this our all!

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:17.870
But...

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:22.160
I can't believe she'd stain these beautiful flowers with darkness like that. {Mouth starts moving well before the line.}

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:26.420
Once I destroy you two, I'll become the real thing.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:41.180
We have to defeat that impostor Precure this time!

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:42.630
Yes...

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:47.110
But there's no way we can defeat
 Dark Precure in our current shape.

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:50.650
If we combine our strength, we'll make it happen somehow!

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:52.030
Right.

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.150
We have to do something.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.780
Hee-ya!

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:56.870
What is it?

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:05.090
The second you put those two brothers together, they start doing silly things.

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:07.440
Hey, hold on a second!

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:13.990
{OP}

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:17.180
HeartCatch

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:18.640
Precure!

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:22.180
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:25.190
Now, all together

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:27.700
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:30.660
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:38.280
Within each of our chests,

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.950
they begin to sprout

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:42.580
The seeds of the heart

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:43.870
are growing

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:46.500
bit by bit

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:47.170
Red,

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:47.790
white

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:49.080
and yellow

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:51.880
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:53.300
all varied colors

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:54.760
that they

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:56.920
shine so brightly!

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:02.260
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:04.770
with such care

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:07.480
will never wither

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:11.060
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:13.940
Now, all together

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:16.400
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:19.070
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:23.950
They're always right by our sides

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:24.790
So together

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:28.670
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:31.620
bloom even more!

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.120
HeartCatch

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:34.630
Precure!

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:43.350
In spring, the dawn — when the slowly paling mountain rim is tinged with red,

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:48.850
and wisps of faintly crimson-purple cloud float in the sky.

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:51.860
All right, that'll do. Masato, 
continue from where he left off.

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:53.300
Ah, um...

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.230
Page 20!

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:55.940
Okay!

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:56.610
Ow!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.960
And just who were you responding to there?

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:00.730
I wasn't! I mean...

00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:02.530
Masato, can you stand up for a second?

00:03:02.940 --> 00:03:03.490
Huh?

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:09.160
Exactly <i>when</i> did our school's uniform replace its indoor shoes with kung fu shoes? {This line seems to disappear a little bit fast.}

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:11.040
Oh, these?

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:14.570
I thought that by wearing these, I'd be ready no matter when the enemy chose to strike!

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:16.350
Yo, Kung Fu Master!

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.510
All right, settle down. {Quieten -> quiet}

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:25.050
Your tastes are your own business, but make sure 
you wear your indoor shoes when you're in school.

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:27.280
Now, let's continue the lesson.

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:31.940
<i>Kung Fu Master?</i>

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:39.400
Hee-ya<i>!</i>

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:39.400
Hee-ya<i>!</i>

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:44.710
Hanasaki, thank you for saving me earlier.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:46.240
You're quite welcome!

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.750
So, you know kung fu, Sakai?

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.870
Yeah. I've pretty much mastered the style.

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:53.290
That's amazing!

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:54.380
I guess!

00:03:56.560 --> 00:04:00.760
Tsubomi, there's no way that Sakai could actually know kung fu!

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:04.840
Even if he says he's mastered it, he's probably just imitating his kung fu movies. {it's -> he's.}

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:07.840
That's not true! I've actually learned the style!

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.560
If I used my kung fu seriously...

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.560
then no other martial art could even compare!

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.480
Now I've gotten him started...

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.700
I-Is that really true?!

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:21.600
Please teach me kung fu as well!

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.070
Huh? Are you serious?

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.070
I'm serious!

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:30.660
Well then, I'm off to learn kung fu!

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:31.570
Huh?

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:32.960
Hee-ya!

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:36.750
Tsubomi... why are you so fired up about this?

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:41.570
First of all, you need to master the steps laid out by the markings.

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:42.880
O-Okay!

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:45.930
Hey, bro, what're you doing?

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:48.140
Yoshito! You're late!

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:50.180
Who's she?

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:52.600
She's Hanasaki Tsubomi from my class.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:55.320
It seems she wants to learn kung fu too.

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:56.370
I'm Hanasaki Tsubomi—

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:57.980
Bro only needs one pupil, and that's me!

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:58.860
Huh?!

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:00.010
Yoshito!

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:04.370
Having another pupil means you'll have someone to practice against, see?

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:05.910
Yessir...

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:07.960
Nice to meet you, Yoshito!

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:09.060
That's wrong!

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:09.630
Huh?

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:12.430
I'm bro's first pupil!

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:15.920
And you're his second, so you should say "Nice to be working with you!"

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:16.890
Oh!

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:19.630
I was first, so show me some respect!

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:24.020
Got it! Nice to be working with you, Yoshito!

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:25.780
Nice to meet you too, Tsubomi.

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:27.190
All right then, let's begin practice.

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:28.000
O-Okay!

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:28.970
You should answer with "Yessir!"

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.510
Y-Yessir!

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:35.390
In combat, it's critical that you're not 
fooled by your opponent's movements. {Strung along -> distracted. Same meaning, slightly less clunky phrasing. Could also be 'fooled.'}

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:40.020
That's why you mustn't merely see your opponent, but feel with your heart how they're going to act.

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:41.860
Yessir!

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:45.440
Controlling nunchucks is very difficult.

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.090
Don't think. Feel!

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:50.930
Don't merely perceive with your eyes, but feel with your heart!

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:51.490
Yessir!

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:52.830
Y-Yessir!

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:55.460
All right, then continue with that.

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:56.360
Yessir!

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:59.250
That seems fun!

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:03.590
Feel it with your heart!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.050
Y-Yessir...

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:08.000
Just what are you doing, Tsubomi...

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:12.080
She's working so hard to try
 to get rid of her weaknesses. {to -> and. Also changed 'weakness' to 'weaknesses.' Also also changed 'cast away' to 'get rid of.'}

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:13.100
That's right!

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:19.290
It's very important to have all the various forms at your disposal.

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:22.110
The crane! The tiger! The snake!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:24.860
Tsubomi!

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:26.570
Erika!

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:29.930
Kung fu is seriously amazing!

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:31.280
You should try it too, Erika!

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:34.020
No, I'm fine, really!

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:35.800
What are you doing here, Kurumi?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.710
I was worried about Tsubomi, so I...

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:42.940
And I wanted to apologize for 
saying you couldn't do kung fu.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:44.410
It's all right.

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:46.690
All right, then you can be his third pupil!

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.220
It's settled, then!

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:55.770
And remember to practice all that, you two!

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:56.770
Yessir!

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:01.520
That little brother of his has quite the attitude, doesn't he? {a nerve -> the attitude}

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:05.160
He really admires Sakai from the bottom of his heart.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:09.570
I don't think I could ever bring 
myself to idolize Momo like that.

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:14.490
Haa. Haa. Haa. Haa!

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:16.720
Hey, Tsubomi...

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:19.750
Why did you suddenly want to learn kung fu?

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.270
I've been kinda worried.

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:26.450
I want to learn something new and become stronger. {Edited from 'empower myself'}

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.760
I'm not sure how this'll sound coming from me...

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:32.760
but Tsubomi, you're not as weak as you make yourself out to be.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:34.100
Huh?

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:37.830
We're growing closer and closer together as the days go by. {If they had done the slow zoom on this line instead, it would have been the greatest visual pun.}

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:40.690
That's why no matter what
 happens, we'll make it work out!

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:44.400
Yeah...

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:45.520
There!

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:50.530
Don't let that get you down!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.000
Keep fighting, Tsubomi!

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:53.250
Right...

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:59.420
<i>Don't think. Feel!</i>

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:02.420
<i>Don't merely perceive with your eyes, but feel it with your heart!</i>

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:03.370
<i>All right...</i>

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.130
Send the next one right.

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:05.960
<i>It's coming!</i>

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:10.920
That huuuuuurt!

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:13.520
Hanasaki, are you all right?

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:16.390
<i>I really am useless...</i>

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:18.450
Bow!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:25.600
You said yer kung fu could beat any kind of martial art, didn't cha?

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.180
I-I didn't mean...

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:30.150
Go!

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:34.410
Point!

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:36.000
That's it?

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.580
Aren'tcha supposed to be strong?

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:40.540
I-It's because this is a Judo lesson...

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:43.710
Then try yer kung fu next time!

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:46.000
Yer just a kung fu nerd after all, ain'tcha?

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:52.360
<i>Sakai...</i>

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:53.970
See ya!

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:54.590
See you tomorrow.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:59.350
Sakai, I'll be giving it my all again today!

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:01.780
I won't be teaching you kung fu anymore.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:05.410
You saw from our P.E. lesson, didn't you?

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:09.400
In an actual match, I tense up, and I'm completely useless...

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.400
But that was just because—

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.650
I'm sorry!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:12.690
Wait, Sakai!

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:27.340
Hmph!

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:36.510
I don't know what this Dark Precure of his is up to, but I wish he'd entrust this to me.

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:43.160
Use that unyielding power of yours to crush the Precure!

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:44.890
Go now, Kumojacky.

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:47.450
Oh, how I have longed to hear those words!

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:07.040
Yoshito!

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:08.730
Hey, bro!

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:11.790
Practice is canceled. We're going home. {Mouth starts moving before line starts.}

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:14.960
Why? Tsubomi's on her way, isn't she?

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.260
That's enough!

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:18.060
But...

00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:20.640
Yo, Kung Fu Master!

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:25.270
Done playin' kung fu already? {Oh god there's more.}

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:27.300
Who the hell are you?!

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:30.190
So this is the guy ya flattened in Judo?

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:32.720
Don't make fun of my bro!

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:33.360
Stop.

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:35.440
But...

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:37.950
Hey, what're you doing?!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:42.070
You're pretty cheeky for the little 
brother of a kung fu nerd, ain'tcha?

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:43.140
Shut it!

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:46.080
Do you got any clue what my bro'll do to you if you piss him off?!

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:49.420
Please do tell.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.630
Well, Kung Fu Master?

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:56.510
Please give back my brother's nunchucks.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:11:00.970
If you want 'em back, then yer gonna have ta apologize and admit ya can't do kung fu! {yer'll -> yer gonna. Also, I hate accents.}

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:02.810
My bro has nothing to apologize for!

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:04.720
He's the Kung Fu Mast—

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:05.790
I'm sorry!

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:09.540
I can't do kung fu...

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:12.740
That's why I can't match up to your martial arts!

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:13.940
Bro!

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:18.370
Well, if ya get it, then ya should stop runnin' yer mouth.

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:18.900
Give 'em back.

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:21.070
Hee-yaaaa!

00:11:21.730 --> 00:11:22.240
'ere.

00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:29.910
What a wimp!

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:30.730
Yeah!

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:37.710
Why didn't you just beat them up, bro?! {There is a noticeable jump of lag in the raw (I think) between this line and the next one.}

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:41.680
There's no way I could match up to them.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.100
Then forget it!

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:47.220
Yoshito, wait!

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:53.760
<i>Yoshito...</i>

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:55.390
Sakai!

00:11:57.710 --> 00:12:00.120
I still think we should train, despite what you said.

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:03.360
I want to bolster my confidence using kung fu!

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.850
"Haaaaa!" Like that!

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:05.860
Huh?

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:07.950
Is your little brother not here yet?

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:09.490
He's not coming.

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:12.620
He ran off somewhere.

00:12:12.970 --> 00:12:14.850
Did you have a fight or something?

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:17.240
He just realized how weak I actually am, that's all!

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.530
What are you saying?!

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:23.880
You're Yoshito's hero, and nothing will ever change that!

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:27.490
I'm going to go look for Yoshito!

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:30.450
Hey, wait up, Tsubomi!

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.820
<i>Bro wasn't himself back there!</i>

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:41.080
That weapon of yours looks rather interesting.

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:46.030
Who are you people?!

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:51.700
But such a fine weapon...

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:57.790
is ill-suited to the hands of one whose Flower of the Heart is so weak!

00:12:58.320 --> 00:12:59.380
Wha—?!

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:01.880
Give back those nunchucks! My bro gave me those!

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:05.840
Flower of the Heart, show yourself!

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:18.430
You're up, Desertrian!

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.360
Hee-yaaaa!

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.060
We can't seem to find Yoshito anywhere.

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:28.180
Tsubomi, we'll be able to practice kung fu some other time, so—

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:29.920
That's no good!

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:36.210
It's not just about kung fu. Sakai and Yoshito are brothers, so we can't just let them fight like this! {fall out -> fight}

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.370
K{*\fs55.217}i{*\fs55.435}b{*\fs55.652}o{*\fs55.87}u{*\fs56.087}g{*\fs56.304}a{*\fs56.522}h{*\fs56.739}a{*\fs56.957}n{*\fs57.174}a {*\fs57.609}I{*\fs57.826}n{*\fs58.043}a{*\fs58.261}r{*\fs58.478}i {*\fs58.913}S{*\fs59.13}h{*\fs59.348}r{*\fs59.565}i{*\fs59.783}ne

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:37.370
All right then!

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.220
If that's how it is, Tsubomi, then I'll help you look!

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:41.960
Thank you, Erika!

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.410
Hee-yaaaa!

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:46.640
I hate you, bro!

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:48.080
It couldn't be...

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:50.090
It's a Desertrian!

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:52.260
Tsubomi, Erika, hurry and transform!

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:05.880
Go, Seeds of the Precure!

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:10.410
Precure!

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:11.950
Open My Heart!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:59.720
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:05.000
Cure Blossom!

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:10.550
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:14.960
Cure Marine!

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:22.340
HeartCatch Precure!

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:28.610
Stop that at once!{I like the way Kumojacky's just sitting under the cherry blossoms on the left}

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:32.360
Give that crystal back right now!

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:33.880
So you're finally here.

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:36.030
I've been waiting for you, Precure.

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:39.250
Let's go, Blossom!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:40.080
Right!

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:44.960
Marine Dynamite!

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:51.590
Hee-ya!

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:56.890
Hee-yaya!

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:12.320
I hate you, bro!

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:14.740
Hee-ya!

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:23.830
Marine Shoot!

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:30.380
Because of those nunchucks, I can't find an opening! {nunchakus -> nunchaku}

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:33.310
Looks like you're no match, Precure.

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:35.550
Merely watching this is boring me.

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:38.820
I don't want my bro to be so pathetic!

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:41.140
Is that... Yoshito?!{Oh thank god I was finding it hard to keep that going any longer.}

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:47.440
Blossom Impact!

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:52.050
Hey, over here, Desertrian!

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.330
Are you all right?! {all right -> all right. Yes, I know. It reads better in this form.}

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:57.510
Y-Yeah!

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:00.490
I hate you so much, bro!

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.490
I hate you, bro!

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:10.210
That monster is Yoshito...

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:11.340
That's not true!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:13.600
The real Yoshito is over there!

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:14.130
Huh?!

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:18.470
Yoshito is trapped within that crystal!

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:30.190
The Precure are in trouble!

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:35.840
I have to save him.

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:38.810
I have to save him!

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:47.120
If bro had actually tried, he would've been able to beat them in a flash!

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:49.290
Your bro can't...

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:53.200
Hmph!

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:58.540
Even if that was true, a coward who can't act when it counts is already a loser before he's begun! {added 'already'}

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:00.180
He's not a coward!

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:09.310
At times, everyone feels like things are beyond them! {Changed 'bears the weakness of feeling that they're incapable!' to this, because the original didn't really flow well conversationally.}

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:15.490
But you're just using your underhanded ways to play with the bond that ties them together!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:19.610
I've had it up to here with this!

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:21.120
Hee-yayayayaya!

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.580
You'll find no openings in those nunchucks.

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:27.410
Blossom?

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:32.750
<i>Don't think. Feel!</i>

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:35.900
<i>Don't merely perceive with your eyes, but feel it with your heart!</i>

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.090
I feel it!

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:39.430
Hee-yaaaa!

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:42.970
Blossom Double Impact!

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:44.850
Tch...

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:48.730
Now's your chance!

00:18:57.400 --> 00:19:00.110
Gather, Floral Power!

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:03.740
Blossom Tact!

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:14.320
Flowers, shine forth!

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:21.940
Precure Pink Forte Wave!

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:44.370
Yay! You did it!

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:48.080
Tch... All right, you lot! When we get back, you're redoing your training!

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:59.810
Now, hurry and restore Yoshito to normal!

00:19:59.810 --> 00:20:01.120
Restore him!

00:20:01.120 --> 00:20:01.760
Okay!

00:20:05.340 --> 00:20:06.930
Yoshito... Yoshito!

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:12.270
Bro?

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:16.400
Yoshito, are you okay?

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:19.240
What happened to me?

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:25.490
There was this monster with nunchucks, and then you came and...

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:26.220
Yeah.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:30.830
I think we might have been dreaming, but everything's all right now!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.120
Is that...

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:38.090
Well, when I get serious, I end up hurting myself a bit! {Removed 'am gonna' and added 'looks like.'}

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:39.880
Hee-yaaaa!

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:44.090
That's the bro I know! I mean... Master!{they've been using 'Master' in English throughout the ep but he's using 'shishou' as in a mentor. It's the term Domon refers to Master Asia as in G Gundam though so I'm pretty cool with that}

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:45.730
Of course it is!

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:49.740
Master, let's go train at the park!

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:50.440
Sure!

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:52.520
I think I finally understand.

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:53.680
Tsubomi?

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:55.800
Even if I do strengthen myself with kung fu,

00:20:55.800 --> 00:21:00.820
if I don't have a heart strong enough to believe I can win, I won't be able to beat anyone.

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:03.460
Jeez, that's what I've been telling you!

00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:05.660
Neither of us are weak! {why -> what. Also Jeez -> Fuck because this scene deserves far cruder language. Also HOLY FUCK HER EYES ARE BIGGER THAN TSUBOMI'S}

00:21:06.150 --> 00:21:09.900
No matter who's in our way, Dark Precure or otherwise, we'll get by somehow!

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:11.620
We can do it... right?

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:13.350
Of course we can!

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:19.500
I think a Heart Seed's about to be born...

00:21:30.820 --> 00:21:35.600
This will restore the Great Heart Tree a little more!

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:39.760
In the language of flowers, a digitalis means "burning passion."

00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:41.300
Hee-ya!

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:41.820
Huh?

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:45.280
Finisher! Form of the Snake! Hiss, hiss, hiss!

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:48.740
Then I'll use the Form of the Tiger! Roar, roar!

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:50.750
Not bad at all, Erika!

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:52.130
You're not so bad yourself!

00:21:52.780 --> 00:21:54.320
Those two sure are...

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:55.540
...way too easygoing.

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:57.580
Hee-yaaaaa!

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:00.370
Hee-yaaaaa!

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:09.830
{ED}

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:18.770
HeartCatch!

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:21.690
HeartCatch!

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:24.610
HeartCatch!

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:27.570
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:36.120
The flower blooms with an "Open sesame!"

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:39.080
In the wardrobe of my heart

00:22:39.630 --> 00:22:42.250
are all the things that a girl loves

00:22:42.550 --> 00:22:44.710
Look, they're packed in so tight

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:48.130
My makeover was a huge success

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.680
thanks to this scrunchie and this frilly tunic!

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:53.680
Our girly showtime

00:22:54.060 --> 00:22:56.520
is about to begin!

00:22:57.020 --> 00:22:59.730
Is my coordination lookin' good today?

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:02.650
Shuffle! Colorful! Beautiful!

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:05.570
Mismatches are just part of my character v(^^)v

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:07.110
We're pretty

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:08.910
at full bloom!

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:12.030
If you polish your heart

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:15.080
until it shines

00:23:15.410 --> 00:23:16.620
Then even the darkness

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:20.870
will become a guiding light

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:23.880
So don't sulk

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:26.800
because a smile's the best!

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:30.260
Let's make them bloom, facing the sun

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:33.470
The flowers of our hearts

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:36.350
HeartCatch!

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.810
HeartCatch Precure!

